# DIFFCOV REACH MEASUREMENT — measurement only, NO mechanism gates.
# Serves witness-study caveat (b) / plan 8.35: "coverable ≠ reached".
# First run with --diffcov live: every leg's result.jsonl carries, per
# harness execution, `[diffcov] method=… hits=N` for each patch-changed
# method (zeros included — the zeros are the signal). The counts feed no
# prompt, no verifier evidence, no gate, no verdict; outcomes are
# recorded as denominator data only, nothing banked.
#
# LEG SELECTION (one draw each; reach is a per-input-distribution
# property, not an outcome lottery, so n=1 per leg is the right spend
# for a zero/non-zero reading):
#   Chart-19-o — the 8.35 FORK-ORACLE leg. Expected: hits>0 (the re-read
#                proved the input reaches indexOf); a zero would
#                contradict 8.35 and reopen it.
#   Lang-63-o  — actually-missed leg, NO witness, reach UNKNOWN. The
#                measurement's real target.
#   Lang-41-o  — same.
#   Math-2-o   — known-catch leg (8.31 safety canary): expect hits>0
#                alongside a conviction; positive control that the
#                counter fires on a catching leg.
#   Math-65-c  — correct leg: clean-side check that instrumentation
#                perturbs nothing (verdict must stay a correct
#                dismissal; any new false alarm here is a hard stop on
#                the diffcov build).
#
# READ, per leg: the diffcov table (method × harness × hits), the
# unmapped list (changed lines with no instrumentable method), and the
# usual outcome — reach and signal reported SEPARATELY, per 8.35.
MODEL="gpt-5.4"
COMMON="-n 5 -m 12 --fuzz_timeout 20 --verify_timeout 20 --verify_relations --synthesize_relations --replay_relations_on_patched --rule_compile_repair --reference_impl --diffcov"
CASES=(
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Chart/patch1-Chart-19-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Lang/patch1-Lang-63-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Lang/patch1-Lang-41-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Math/patch1-Math-2-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/CapGen/Math/patch1-Math-65-CapGen.patch"
)
